==Battleground==
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 58.67 seconds<sup>1,760f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 66 seconds<sup>1,980f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 66.67~100 seconds<sup>2,000f~3,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'noir]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 33.33~50 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,500f</sup>.
**1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns.
**1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns.

==Strategy==
For the peons, using [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attack Cats]] such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] or [[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed UFO Cat]] will take care of them. For the boss, you must use cats that have a longer range than 410 ([[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Wolf]]) so that Le'noir doesn't hit them. Protect them well.

Alternatively, [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazer]] can solo this level.

===Recommended Ubers===
If you don't have Dark Lazer, you can use some of the many anti-Dark [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Ubers]]. Some of the most notable are [[Vars (Uber Rare Cat)|Vars]] and three of the [[Sengoku Wargods Vajiras (Gacha Event)|Sengoku Wargods Vajiras]] units: [[Oda Nobunaga (Uber Rare Cat)|Oda Nobunaga]], [[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Sanada Yukimura]], and [[Maeda Keiji (Uber Rare Cat)|Maeda Keiji]].
*Vars: Vars has longer range than Le'noir (445 vs 410), and he has a chance to knockback and slow Dark enemies. This can help prevent Le'noir from advancing. Vars also has a quick attack rate, so with enough luck and meatshields, Le'noir will barely be able to hit Vars.
*Oda Nobunaga: Oda Nobunaga has a quick attack rate and a 100% chance to freeze Dark enemies for 180f. His attack speed is less than 180f, so as long as Le'noir is hit by Nobunaga, you have pretty much won the level, as Le'noir only has one knockback.
*Maeda Keiji: Has high health and takes greatly reduced damage from Dark enemies. Not too much damage and range, but is a useful tank against Le'noir, protecting longer-ranged cats like Bahamut.
*Sanada Yukimura: Sanada has a quick attack animation and can deal massive damage to Dark enemies. As a plus, he has multiple knockbacks that can be useful for getting his attack back and going back in to take out Le'noir and Shadow Boxer K. If you have his true form then you can beat the stage very easily.

